        "description": "\ud83d\udd12 Security: Enforced SSL certificate validation in HTTP clients\nWhat: Removed insecure `ssl_context.check_hostname = False` and `ssl_context.verify_mode = ssl.CERT_NONE` overrides in `multi_llm_video_processor.py` and `markdown_video_processor.py`.\n\nRisk: Disabling SSL verification allows MITM (Man-in-the-Middle) attacks, compromising the confidentiality and integrity of communications with AI providers.\n\nSolution: Restored secure defaults by relying solely on `ssl.create_default_context()`, ensuring robust certificate validation.\n\n---\n*PR created automatically by Jules for task [5669839764848871090](https://jules.google.com/task/5669839764848871090) started by @groupthinking*",
